            "review_title": "Review at Quan Oc Ngon",
            "review_text": "Rita\nMui Ne, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nDelicious Vietnamese food\nAug 2025 • Friends\nSeafood, from a favorite restaurant in Nha Trang. Apart from lobster and crab, a plate of seafood costs about 13-19 RMB. I have to indulge in dozens of plates every time. All flavors are good. There is a young lady in the restaurant who can speak basic English, making ordering very convenient. They give away free bananas, which are very green yet delicious.\nRead more\nWritten August 27, 2025",
